# AI replies

Source: `packages/web/src/features/ai-reply/ai-reply.api.ts`, `ai-reply.model.ts`, and `ai-reply.types.ts` in that directory.

- A mock provider or HTTP provider factory does not establish a deployed backend contract. Verify provider selection, callers, and the backend contract before enabling a feature.
- Keep generated text as a preview or draft until the user accepts it; do not turn suggestion acceptance into automatic sending without an explicit product requirement.
- Preserve abort and stale-result protection when the draft, chat, or runtime changes.
- Send only the context needed for the requested action. Do not send messages to third-party services without explicit consent, or place message content and suggestions in analytics.
- Import concrete files. Keep this reply foundation separate from any independently implemented topic-summary flow.
